# Source of truth (portfolio content)

When adding professional profile information:

- Do not invent employers, roles, metrics, technologies, or outcomes.
- Do not inflate seniority or scope.
- If data is missing, use explicit placeholders or ask the owner for copy.
- The project should demonstrate skill through engineering quality, not fictional résumé entries.
